+To create a one-stop shop for all physical media collections, bridging the gap between casual tracking and professional-grade cataloging.
+
+## Key Features
+
+- **Multi-Modal Cataloging**:
+  - **AI Image Recognition**: Identify items by simply taking a photo of the cover.
+  - **Barcode Scanning**: Quickly add items using their UPC/EAN.
+  - **Manual Entry**: Full control over item details for rare or unlisted items.
+- **Integrated Marketplace**:
+  - Buy and sell items directly within the platform.
+  - Smart pricing recommendations based on item condition (Low, Medium, High).
+  - Low-friction transactions with a flat 3% platform fee.
+- **Collection Management**:
+  - Organize by name, release date, artist/author, or market value.
+  - Track detailed metadata: pressing location, exclusivity, and condition.
+  - Wishlist management to track desired additions.
+- **Social Features**:
+  - Connect with friends to view their collections and wishlists.
+  - Privacy controls: Set collections to Public, Private, or Friends-Only.
+  - Real-time notifications for marketplace activity and friend requests.
+
+## Supported Media
+
+Amadeus supports a wide variety of physical formats, including:
+- **Video**: DVDs, Blu-rays
+- **Music**: CDs, Vinyl Records, Cassettes
+- **Literature**: Books
+- **Gaming**: Game discs and cartridges
+- **Collectibles**: Signed editions and more
+
+## Target Audience
+
+- **Casual Collectors**: Individuals with varied collections looking for a simple, unified way to track their items.
+- **Avid Enthusiasts**: Power users who value market valuation, portfolio management, and social interaction.
+- **Marketplace Users**: Buyers and sellers looking for a dedicated physical media trading hub.
+- **Store Accounts**: Independent retailers looking to showcase and sell their inventory online.
+
